mushroom magic~
   A mushroom of shimmering existence, these morsels are called into being
from pure magic.  The cap is a delicate lavender color, full and firm, the
underside packed with dense gills.  A thick, meaty stem attaches at the
center.  Despite their otherworldly nature, the mushrooms are filling and
fairly tasty, if terribly monotonous when eaten over weeks on end.    
~
