E
trophy corpse kitten~
   Silky black fur streaked with grey stripes adorns this kitten and you
almost can't see the black collar with a bell and little tag around her neck.
She looks up at you, expecting a to be petted or get a treat at the least.  
Her glass eyes glow in the dark, cutting straight to your soul.  She yawns
with a fixed open gape forever frozen in that look of surprise when Iluvatar
pierced her heart after a fierce battle.    

A large button sticks out prominently on the neck waiting for a push.
~
